OL,3,ATrump says he can do business with
OL,4,ABurnham but criticises 'terrible'
OL,5,AChagos deal
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrump has also met President Zelensky
OL,8,Fon the sidelines
OL,10,FEarlier, Trump warned Iran it could
OL,11,Fface "annihilation" without a US deal -
OL,12,Falthough he said he believed an
OL,13,Fagreement would be made after US
OL,14,Fmid-term elections in November
OL,16,FOn Ukraine, Trump again claimed an end
OL,17,Fto the war with Russia is near - while
OL,18,Fhe also said the US will rename AI as
OL,19,F"super intelligence"
